<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Test-Time Training with KV Binding Is Secretly Linear Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Proof of Theorem <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a>
