<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Appendix D Proof of Theorem ‣ Test-Time Training with KV Binding Is Secretly Linear Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Inductive step.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A4.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix D Proof of Theorem ‣ Test-Time Training with KV Binding Is Secretly Linear Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Weight accumulation.</span></a></li>
