</span></li>
<li id="bib.bib7" class="ltx_bibitem ltx_bib_article"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_bib_author-year ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhou <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span> (2018)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">T. Zhou, R. Tucker, J. Flynn, G. Fyffe, and N. Snavely</span>
</span>
